<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111034" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλίππειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἠνορέη, κεφαλή,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			9.288
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Gem.
		</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
			519
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Alc.
		</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηγή</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
			Paus.
			8.7.4
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
			Philip,</i> ll. cc., etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φ. στατῆρες</span>”
				<i>gold didrachms coined by Philip,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					9.59
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				84
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				826
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>I</u>
				15
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				16.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλίππειον</span></b> , τό his temple at Olympia, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.20.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φιλίππεια, τά,</span> festival in his honour, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				32.110
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
